    "output": "\n\n## \u53c2\u8003\u6587\u732e\n\n<a id=\"ref-1\"></a>**[1]** en.wikipedia.org \u2014 Shanghai Stock Exchange - Wikipedia\nURL: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shanghai_Stock_Exchange\n\u539f\u6587\u7247\u6bb5\uff1a\u300cShanghai Stock Exchange - Wikipedia Jump to content Coordinates : 31\u00b014\u203212.3\u2033N 121\u00b030\u203231.5\u2033E \ufeff / \ufeff 31.236750\u00b0N 121.508750\u00b0E \ufeff / 31.236750; 121.508750 From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia Stock exchange in Shanghai, China Shanghai Stock Exchange \u4e0a\u6d77\u8bc1\u5238\u4ea4\u6613\u6240 Type Stock exchange Locati...\u300d\n\n<a id=\"ref-2\"></a>**[2]** english.sse.com.cn \u2014 SHANGHAI STOCK EXCHANGE\nURL: https://english.sse.com.cn/aboutsse/overview\n\u539f\u6587\u7247\u6bb5\uff1a\u300cSHANGHAI STOCK EXCHANGE Overview History and Development Shanghai is Mainland China\u2019s first city to see the emergence of stocks, stock trading and stock exchanges. Stock trading started in Shanghai as early as the 1860s. In 1891, the Shanghai Share Brokers Association, an early f...\u300d\n\n<a id=\"ref-3\"></a>**[3]** expatinvestchina.com \u2014 The Shanghai Stock Exchange: An Introduction\nURL: https://expatinvestchina.com/the-shanghai-stock-exchange-an-introduction\n\u539f\u6587\u7247\u6bb5\uff1a\u300cThe Shanghai Stock Exchange: An Introduction Skip to content The modern version of the Shanghai Stock Exchange (SSE) was established in November 1990, making it only 32 years old. In that time it has grown rapidly to become the third-largest exchange by market cap in the world! L...\u300d\n\n<a id=\"ref-4\"></a>**[4]** sse.com.cn \u2014 \u4ea4\u6613\u6240\u4ecb\u7ecd  | \u4e0a\u6d77\u8bc1\u5238\u4ea4\u6613\u6240\nURL: http://www.sse.com.cn/aboutus/sseintroduction/introduction\n\u539f\u6587\u7247\u6bb5\uff1a\u300c\u4ea4\u6613\u6240\u4ecb\u7ecd | \u4e0a\u6d77\u8bc1\u5238\u4ea4\u6613\u6240 \u4e0a\u6d77\u8bc1\u5238\u4ea4\u6613\u6240\u670d\u52a1\u70ed\u7ebf\uff1a 400-8888-400 APP\u4e0b\u8f7d \u5fa